      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It sort of comes and goes. Antihistamines helps a bit. I'd call it moderate. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I did try to ignore it for a while.",
